  "sourceTitle": "Garlic Herb Mayonnaise",
  "sourceText": "Garlic Herb Mayonnaise\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Saturday, December 12, 2009 - 11:58pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 Clove (small) garlic, minced\n1 tablespoon Chopped parsley\n1/2 cup Low or no-fat mayonnaise\n\nPreparation\n\n1 1. In a small bowl combine garlic, parsley and mayonnaise. 2 2. Cover and refrigerate an hour for flavors to blend. 3 NOTE: A great spread for turkey stacked on crusty French bread.",
